WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.668
Practice 1 reshapes student grades The source is
long one

00:00:05.695 --> 00:00:11.536
student-course grade per row The output should have
one row per student and fixed

00:00:11.563 --> 00:00:17.084
course columns A missing course should remain NULL
because no recorded grade

00:00:17.097 --> 00:00:18.900
is not the same as a grade of zero
